BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316529699@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061448Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261127T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nAs always\, we will go at a moderate pace and won’t leave an
 yone behind. But please be considerate of others if you don't think you wi
 ll be able to hike/walk at a moderate pace for the duration.\n\nEagle Rock
  Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and valleys located on the 
 borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, New Jersey. Though locat
 ed in the middle of the most densely populated county in the most densely 
 populated state in the country\, the Reservation is mostly undeveloped and
  boasts an extensive trail system within its borders.\n\n**Please make sur
 e to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.**\n\nFOLLOW US ON INST
 AGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us for a hike\, please u
 nderstand that you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-bein
 g and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or mishap. Event will
  be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316529699/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260912T173031Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260912T173031Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_317177534@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061448Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261204T110000
SUMMARY:🥾 Let's Hike!! at Garret Mountain 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nGarret Mountain Yellow and White Loop Trail is a
  heavily trafficked loop trail located near Woodland Park\, New Jersey tha
 t features a lake and is good for all skill levels. The trail offers a num
 ber of activity options and is best used from March until October.\n\n**PL
 EASE ARRIVE 5 MINUTES EARLY SO WE CAN START ON TIME!**\n\nWe will hike a m
 oderate 3 miles. This is **not** a paved trail\, please do **not** wear sn
 eakers.\n\nWe will meet in the **Auto Overlook** parking lot. It’s a one
  way\, you will pass the equestrian\, Lambert Tower before reaching the si
 gn for AUTO OVERLOOK.\n\nAs always\, we will go at a moderate pace and won
 ’t leave anyone behind. But **please be considerate** of others if you d
 on't think you will be able to hike at a moderate pace for the duration.\n
 \n[https://www.google.com/maps/place/Parking+lot\,+Paterson\,+NJ+07503/@40
 .9057189\,-74.1750062\,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c2fdd38a2aa1a1:0x52
 6711cb124756e2!8m2!3d40.905813!4d-74.1750982!16s%2Fg%2F11fx7w406f?hl=en-US
 &entry=ttu](https://www.google.com/maps/place/Parking+lot\,+Paterson\,+NJ+
 07503/@40.9057189\,-74.1750062\,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c2fdd38a2a
 a1a1:0x526711cb124756e2!8m2!3d40.905813!4d-74.1750982!16s%2Fg%2F11fx7w406f
 ?hl=en-US&entry=ttu)\n\nRain or extreme weather will cancel the event.\n\n
 Disclaimer: If you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are res
 ponsible for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one els
 e liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/317177534/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261028T172605Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261028T172605Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
